              "html": "Amara had expected the old market in Accra to feel chaotic. But as she walked between the stalls, she began to notice an underlying order: fabric sellers gathered in one lane, spice traders in another, and every vendor seemed to know exactly where each neighbor’s goods belonged. What had first appeared random was, in fact, highly ______."
